OL,3,CCount begins in Greater Manchester
OL,4,Cmayoral race
OL,6,FAndy Burnham's replacement as Greater
OL,7,FManchester mayor will soon be
OL,8,Fannounced following the largest by-
OL,9,Felection in British history.
OL,11,FVotes from the by-election on
OL,12,FThursday, 30 July, will be counted
OL,13,Fthroughout the day, with the result
OL,14,Fexpected to be declared on Friday
OL,15,Fafternoon.
OL,17,FMore than two million people were
OL,18,Feligible to vote in the contest,
OL,19,Ftriggered by Andy Burnham's election
OL,20,Fto Parliament in June, after he was
OL,21,Felected as the new Makerfield MP.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/8
