OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785503909
OL,3,CCount begins in Greater Manchester
OL,4,Cmayoral race
OL,6,FPolling ahead of the vote suggested
OL,7,FLabour candidate Bev Craig, currently
OL,8,Fthe leader of Manchester City Council,
OL,9,Fwas on course to win by a comfortable
OL,10,Fmargin.
OL,12,FHer main rival is likely to be either
OL,13,FReform UK's Sian Astley or Green
OL,14,FParty's Geraldine Coggins.
OL,16,FOther candidates were the
OL,17,FConservative's Phil Eckersley, Richard
OL,18,FKilpatrick from the Liberal Democrats,
OL,19,FMarlon West of Restore Britain and
OL,20,FMarcus Farmer, who is standing as an
OL,21,FIndependent.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
