OL,3,CCount begins in Greater Manchester
OL,4,Cmayoral race
OL,6,FThe Prime Minister voted at a polling
OL,7,Fstation in Golborne, near Wigan,
OL,8,Fcasting his ballot less than an hour
OL,9,Fbefore polls closed.
OL,11,FAfter voting finished, Labour deputy
OL,12,Fleader Lucy Powell said her party had
OL,13,Frun "a really positive campaign" and
OL,14,Fbeen "on the front foot, setting out
OL,15,Four stall, showing what Labour in
OL,16,Fpower can do".
OL,26,@uD@EOUuD@`O]vD@FOUxD@MO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
