OL,3,CCount begins in Greater Manchester
OL,4,Cmayoral race
OL,6,FShe said: "A new prime minister who is
OL,7,Fpopular in this region meant that we
OL,8,Fwere contesting this election in
OL,9,Funusual circumstances.
OL,11,F"However, we found real discontent
OL,12,Facross Greater Manchester with how
OL,13,FLabour have been running this place,
OL,14,Fand the people want a change of
OL,15,Fdirection.
OL,17,F"This includes clear commitments on
OL,18,Frent controls, affordable housing and
OL,19,Fto make sure people are put before
OL,20,Fprofit."
OL,26,@nD@KOUyD@AOU|D@HO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/8
