OL,3,CCount begins in Greater Manchester
OL,4,Cmayoral race
OL,6,FVotes will be tallied up at the Co-op
OL,7,FLive Arena on Friday, 31 July, with
OL,8,Fthe winner expected to be announced in
OL,9,Fthe afternoon.
OL,11,FIt is the first time a by-election has
OL,12,Fbeen necessary to fill a vacancy for
OL,13,Fone of England's combined authority
OL,14,Fmayors.
OL,16,FThe cost of the contest is expected
OL,17,Frun into the millions, with the 2024
OL,18,Fmayoral election costing the taxpayer
OL,19,F#4.7 million.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/8
