OL,3,CCount begins in Greater Manchester
OL,4,Cmayoral race
OL,6,FThat contest saw Andy Burnham re-
OL,7,Felected with 63% of the vote under the
OL,8,F"first past the post" system, in which
OL,9,Fthe candidate with the most votes is
OL,10,Fdeclared the winner.
OL,12,FHe also received the most votes in
OL,13,Feach of Greater Manchester's 10 local
OL,14,Fauthority areas.
OL,16,FVoting changed back to the
OL,17,F"supplementary vote" (SV) system used
OL,18,Fin the mayoral elections in 2017 and
OL,19,F2021.
OL,26,@pD@AOUpD@UO]yD@AOUyD@TO]
