OL,3,CCount begins in Greater Manchester
OL,4,Cmayoral race
OL,6,FA candidate wins outright by securing
OL,7,Fover 50% of first-choice votes;
OL,8,Fotherwise, the election advances to a
OL,9,Fsecond-round runoff between the top
OL,10,Ftwo contenders.
OL,12,FFrom Westminster to Washington DC -
OL,13,Four political experts are across all
OL,14,Fthe latest key talking points. Listen
OL,15,Fto the latest episode below...
